---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Blog | Bar Moon Contracting">
  <Header />
  
  <main class="pt-20 bg-light-neutral text-primary">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Blog</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-10">Practical guides and insights from the field. We share straightforward advice on home building, renovations, painting, roofing, and outdoor living in Central Texas.</p>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Teaser 1 -->
        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">July 10, 2026</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-1 mb-3">
            <a href="/blog/how-to-read-a-contractors-estimate" class="hover:text-accent transition">How to Read a Contractor’s Estimate (and Prepare for Your Project)</a>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">A clear estimate and a well-prepared homeowner go a long way toward keeping a project on time, on budget, and free from unnecessary stress. This practical guide breaks down exactly what to look for in a professional estimate and how your own preparation makes a real difference.</p>
          <a href="/blog/how-to-read-a-contractors-estimate" class="inline-flex items-center bg-accent hover:bg-gold text-dark-blue font-bold text-sm px-5 py-2 rounded-lg transition">
            Read the full guide →
          </a>
        </article>

        <!-- Teaser 2 -->
        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">July 7, 2026</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-1 mb-3">
            <a href="/blog/how-to-choose-a-general-contractor" class="hover:text-accent transition">How to Choose a General Contractor in Central Texas (and Avoid Costly Mistakes)</a>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Most problems start with timing and the wrong contractor choice. This guide shows what really matters when hiring, the red flags to watch for, and how to make a confident decision before your project begins.</p>
          <a href="/blog/how-to-choose-a-general-contractor" class="inline-flex items-center bg-accent hover:bg-gold text-dark-blue font-bold text-sm px-5 py-2 rounded-lg transition">
            Read the full guide →
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-12 text-sm text-gray-500">Check back for more posts, or contact us for project-specific advice.</p>

      <img src="/images/grok-planning.jpg" alt="Project planning session" class="mt-8 rounded-xl w-full max-w-lg mx-auto" />
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
